1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hemnes Gård og Slekt, Ytterlien''': [https://caolsson.wiki.zoho.com/128-Ytterlien.html]
2 CONT
2 CONT Det skal være Jörn forsamling, skellefteå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kopi fra "Find a grave":  Emma Kristina Larsdatter was born May 12 1849 in the Lundbacka parish of Jörn, Västerbotten, Sweden to Lars Olof Larsson and Greta Caisa Norgren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On December 31 1869 she gave birth to Marie Lovise Johansdatter. Marie lived less than one month, passing on January 2 1870.
2 CONT
2 CONT On July 16 1876 she married David Anders Davidsen in Korgen, Nordland, Norway. They resided at Ytterli farm and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT - Kristen Edvard Davidsen Brattli - Martin Norgren Davidsen - Jens Nikolai Davidsen - Elise Didrikke Fredrike Davidsdatter - David Esaias Davidsen - Anton Johan Bertin Davidsen
2 CONT
2 CONT FT1875 Hemnes Tveraaen: Hos Iver Iversen f 1833. Emma Kristine Larsdatter tjenstepige född 1849 i Hjörno coppel, Vesterbotten Sverige. Hennes dotter Maria Lovise Pedersdatter född 1869 i Korgen socken, Hemnäs. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Västerbotten - Helgeland samer''': [http://sijtijarnge.no/sorsamiskeslekter/vefslapskk/sida1/h____677.htm]
